Description: Provides methods for meta-analysis of diagnostic test accuracy
    and prognostic studies. The package estimates the summary receiver
    operating characteristic (SROC) curve for diagnostic test accuracy and
    the time-dependent SROC curve for prognostic studies. It also provides
    likelihood-based sensitivity analyses to assess the potential impact of
    publication bias on these curves.
